//! The `column-wrap` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies the
//! wrapping behavior of overflow columns in a [CSS multi-column
//! layout](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Multicol_layout).
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: auto | nowrap | wrap
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-multicol-2/#propdef-column-wrap
//!
//! Author guide: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/column-wrap
